schedule: anchor relative deadlines on the course's own weekday

The weekly schedule (which day each course meets) is now optional config:

    schedule:
      Sistem Penunjang Keputusan: [Senin]
      Testing dan Implementasi Sistem: [Rabu]

Rooms and class hours are deliberately not modelled. When a course's
weekday is known, "minggu depan" resolves to the next occurrence of that
weekday instead of lecture_date + 7, so a lecture uploaded a day late does
not shift the deadline:

  lecture Mon 28 Sep, SPK meets Monday -> 2026-10-05
  same lecture uploaded Tue 29 Sep     -> 2026-10-05 (not Tuesday)

Two weeks maps to the second meeting after the lecture. Without a schedule
entry, resolution falls back to the lecture date (previous behaviour), and
ambiguous phrases ("minggu ketiga") stay null.
